[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unitvolfogspotorigin"]

; Two SpotLight3D origins inside thin volumetric fog in view, as in an ld-58 window: a shadowed
; "Spot" and an unshadowed "Glow". The fog cell around the shadowed origin sits behind the light's
; plane, outside its cone, where the shadow lookup's texel runs far past the atlas. Godot's clamping
; sampler reads the atlas edge there, and the cell scatters nothing. The nested Window transform
; places those cells, so a flattened transform does not show the variable. No other golden puts a
; shadowed spot's origin in view inside the fog. The zero-energy sun keeps the editor's preview sun
; out (ADR-0025).

